  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      176.49,
      204.17,
      387.33,
      229.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE ANURA VIDANAGAMAGE PRAJASANWARDANA PADANAMA",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      245.57,
      401.9,
      325.91
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cAnuraVidanagamage Praja Sanwardana Padanama\u201d has beenestablished in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the Foundation according to the rules agreedto by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      342.17,
      401.9,
      408.71
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      424.97,
      401.89,
      450.11
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      466.37,
      401.88,
      505.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Anura VidanagamagePraja Sanwardana Padanama (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      521.57,
      401.93,
      670.91
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as presently are members ofthe \u201cAnura Vidanagamage Praja Sanwardana Padanama\u201d(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafterbe admitted as members of the Corporation herebyconstituted, shall be a body corporate (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession, underthe name and style of the \u201cAnura Vidanagamage PrajaSanwardana Padanama\u201d and by that name may sue and besued in all courts with full power and authority to have anduse a common seal and alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      247.15,
      443.14,
      256.22
    ],
    "text": "Preamble.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      466.15,
      444.58,
      475.22
    ],
    "text": "Short title.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
