  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      202.73,
      397.17,
      225.83
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      236.09,
      397.18,
      294.23
    ],
    "text": "(a)to provide education, grant scholarships, assist pre-school children, promote educational and sportsactivities and particularly help underprivilegedpoor children to gain education and vocationaltraining;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      304.61,
      397.18,
      351.11
    ],
    "text": "(b)to help disabled persons, elderly and mentallyhandicapped to overcome their suffering and assistthem to lead a better life and improve their livingconditions;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      361.49,
      397.19,
      431.27
    ],
    "text": "(c)to assist unemployed youth and those who havelost their livelihood and provide opportunities forgainful employment and vocations by way offacilities, accommodation, training and otherassistance to regain self sufficiency and toaccomplish their aspirations and lifestyles;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      441.65,
      397.23,
      523.19
    ],
    "text": "(d)to enhance living standards of low income anddisadvantaged families and train and assist them tobe self sufficient and engage in self employmentventures and encourage them to participate ineconomic, cultural and social and sports activitiesand provide opportunities to improve their qualityof life and promote well-being;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      533.57,
      397.18,
      579.95
    ],
    "text": "(e)to undertake industrial and communitydevelopment projects and encourage theparticipation of people in programmes andactivities for their advancement;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      590.33,
      397.2,
      672.47
    ],
    "text": "(f)to assist and support those affected and displacedby natural disasters and other events caused bynatural phenomenon and those affected anddisplaced by disasters and events caused other thanby nature and provide their necessities and helpthem to regain their life style and also to achieve abetter standard of living; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      403.15,
      205.15,
      450.44,
      233.42
    ],
