  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      203.45,
      401.9,
      238.43
    ],
    "text": "(g)to do all such other acts, matters and things as areincidental or conducive to the attainment of theobjectives of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      250.49,
      401.88,
      296.99
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to therules in force for the time being of the Corporation, beadministered by a Board of Management appointed inaccordance with the rules of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      307.37,
      401.9,
      353.75
    ],
    "text": "(2) The first Board of Management of the Corporationshall consist of the members of the Board of Management ofthe Foundation holding office on the day preceding the dateof commencement of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      364.13,
      401.89,
      410.63
    ],
    "text": "(3) Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in sub-section (1) of this Section Mr. Ravendra AnuraVidanagamage shall be the first Chairman of the Board ofManagement of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      422.69,
      401.86,
      445.67
    ],
    "text": "5.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      456.05,
      401.86,
      490.79
    ],
    "text": "(a)to purchase, rent, lease or otherwise acquire landsor buildings which may be required for the purposesof the Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      501.17,
      401.88,
      524.15
    ],
    "text": "(b)to borrow or raise money with or without interestfor the purposes of the Corporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      534.53,
      401.9,
      592.67
    ],
    "text": "(c)to make, draw, accept, discount, endorse, negotiate,buy, sell and issue bills of exchange, cheques,promissory notes and other negotiable instrumentsand to open, operate, maintain and close bankaccounts;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
